WEBVTT

00:06:56.913 --> 00:07:00.329
I was I was 13, not 12, but I
have a very similar story.

00:07:00.871 --> 00:07:03.996
But I just got really good at, like
smoking cigarettes and being wild,

00:07:04.496 --> 00:07:07.204
which was probably not the
best thing to pick.

00:07:07.204 --> 00:07:10.746
But but we all have stories like that

00:07:10.746 --> 00:07:13.329
and we build our armor
around those stories.

00:07:13.746 --> 00:07:17.996
And no one talks about the big
developmental milestone of midlife,

00:07:18.038 --> 00:07:21.954
which can happen, I think, anywhere
between our late 30s and probably mid 50s,

00:07:22.621 --> 00:07:29.079
which is the armor that we put on to
protect us when we were children

00:07:29.079 --> 00:07:34.038
and have less agency and less control
over what was happening.